{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"Formal found a corner case: a standard return can predict from the RAS, then EX can discover its target is misaligned and trap. Since the trap suppresses the normal redirect, fetch had continued at the predicted RAS address. I’m correcting this by redirecting to `pc+4` when a trapping control transfer’s prediction differs from its trap next PC, then I’ll rerun formal."}}
