en targets, and accept ID training updates.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Train the predictor from resolved legal branches and preserve actual branch outcome and prediction metadata for recovery.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Redirect only for a conditional-branch prediction miss, including the sequential correction for predicted-taken branches that resolve not taken.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Connect predictor training and branch recovery signals through the single-issue pipeline.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
