tcome and prediction metadata.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Correct the fetch PC only when the resolved branch direction disagrees with its carried prediction.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Connect table training and misprediction recovery signals through the pipeline.\"\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
