  description: \"Capture predicted next-PC metadata in ID/EX with the decoded instruction.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Expose resolved control-transfer training data and redirect only when actual next PC differs from the carried prediction, including corrections for mispredictions.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Connect EX-resolved transfer updates and pipeline stall qualification to the fetch-stage BTB.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
